# The materialised transitive closure of geo:isLocatedIn for the CQ fixture —
# the extra (a → c) pairs that `make infer` (queries/infer-locatedin.rq) adds
# in build/closure.ttl. Loaded alongside people-and-places.ttl so the PLAIN
# query (no property path) can answer the same competency question.

@prefix geo:   <http://geo.org/> .
@prefix place: <http://example.org/place/> .

place:London geo:isLocatedIn place:Europe .
place:Rotterdam geo:isLocatedIn place:Europe .
place:New_York geo:isLocatedIn place:North_America .
place:Milwaukee geo:isLocatedIn place:North_America .
place:Helsinki geo:isLocatedIn place:Europe .
place:Paoli geo:isLocatedIn place:North_America .
